### ===================================================================
### EKSPERIMEN JWT AUDIENCE (aud) PADA MICROSERVICES
### ===================================================================

@authService = http://localhost:3001
@userService = http://localhost:3002
@orderService = http://localhost:3003

### 1. Periksa Health Status Masing-Masing Service
GET {{authService}}/health

###
GET {{userService}}/health

###
GET {{orderService}}/health


### ===================================================================
### SKENARIO 1: Token untuk USER-SERVICE
### ===================================================================

### 2. Dapatkan Token khusus untuk [user-service] dari Auth Service
# @name issueUserToken
POST {{authService}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi_santoso",
  "audience": "user-service"
}

### Simpan token dari response di atas ke variabel
@userToken = {{issueUserToken.response.body.token}}

### 3. Gunakan Token user-service ke USER-SERVICE (Ekspektasi: 200 OK ✅)
GET {{userService}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4. Coba gunakan Token user-service ke ORDER-SERVICE (Ekspektasi: 403 FORBIDDEN ❌)
### Membuktikan bahwa signature valid tapi aud="user-service" ditolak oleh order-service!
GET {{orderService}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ===================================================================
### SKENARIO 2: Token untuk ORDER-SERVICE
### ===================================================================

### 5. Dapatkan Token khusus untuk [order-service] dari Auth Service
# @name issueOrderToken
POST {{authService}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi_santoso",
  "audience": "order-service"
}

### Simpan token dari response di atas ke variabel
@orderToken = {{issueOrderToken.response.body.token}}

### 6. Gunakan Token order-service ke ORDER-SERVICE (Ekspektasi: 200 OK ✅)
GET {{orderService}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{orderToken}}

### 7. Coba gunakan Token order-service ke USER-SERVICE (Ekspektasi: 403 FORBIDDEN ❌)
### Membuktikan bahwa signature valid tapi aud="order-service" ditolak oleh user-service!
GET {{userService}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{orderToken}}
